            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-tree-transformation",
        "moduleId": "heuristic-optimization",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "查询树变换示例",
        "markdown": "以`SELECT Sname FROM Student, SC WHERE Student.Sno=SC.Sno AND SC.Cno='2'`为例，初始查询树可能在顶部做笛卡儿积，然后选择和投影。优化后的查询树：首先对SC执行选择$\\sigma_{Cno='2'}$，然后将Student与过滤后的SC执行连接，最后投影Sname。这样连接操作的输入从10000个SC元组减少到50个，代价大幅降低。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-heuristic",
            "tb-rules"
          ]
        }
      },
